### Condition 2: Epoch Start (Session Regeneration) — Lines 1272-1278

**Code:**
```typescript
else if (epochStart) {
    console.warn(
        `[SessionManager] epoch-start for ${sessionId} (epoch ${transcriptEpoch}); ` +
        `discarding the warm Copilot session of the previous epoch.`,
